# Agentfile alias. "elit" is Tori's muscle-memory name for the
# plain-language explainer. The generic, user-agnostic template is
# "explain-plain". Keep this file so scripts, memory notes, and chat
# messages that still say "elit" keep working.
# When the parser sees ALIAS <name>, it follows it to the target
# Agentfile and returns that config.

ALIAS explain-plain
